  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may hate mages, but those who cooperate with you get to live, usually.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Know any one of filch the gift, pilfer the gift, steal the gift</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you execute the filch the gift, pilfer the gift, or steal the gift techniques on a willing creature, that creature may choose which spell you steal. When performing steal the gift on a willing creature, do not roll to see what level of spell you get to steal: the subject chooses any 1st through 3rd-level spell to give you instead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
